Package: libvte-2.91-gtk4-0
Version: @DEB_VTE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Terminal/VTE
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libpango-1.0-0, libpcre2-8-0, libfribidi0, libxml2
Description: Terminal emulator widget for GTK4 - runtime
 VTE provides a virtual terminal widget for GTK applications. This package
 contains the GTK4 (libvte-2.91-gtk4) shared library, used by gnome-console.
